[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by his", "start": 4.799, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "excellency", "start": 7.279, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Mr. Aaliyah Sumani, president of the", "start": 8.96, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "Union of the Kamoros. I request protocol", "start": 12.0, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "to escort his excellency and invite him", "start": 15.599, "duration": 7.401}, {"text": "to address the assembly.", "start": 19.199, "duration": 3.801}, {"text": "Excellence", "start": 25.039, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. Land", "start": 40.48, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Mr. President of the General Assembly,", "start": 43.2, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "your Majesties, Your Highnesses,", "start": 45.28, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "the United Nations Secretary General,", "start": 50.8, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Your Excellencies, Heads of State and", "start": 53.52, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Government,", "start": 56.079, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Your", "start": 58.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Excellencies, Heads of Delegations,", "start": 60.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "distinguished guests,", "start": 63.92, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 66.56, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "peace be upon you. At the outset,", "start": 72.88, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "I would like to on behalf of the", "start": 77.28, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Cammorian delegation, I wish to express", "start": 79.52, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "our sincere gratitude to the authorities", "start": 82.4, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "of the United States.", "start": 84.96, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "We thank them for the hospitality", "start": 88.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and arrangements", "start": 92.159, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "extended to us since our arrival in New", "start": 94.32, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "York", "start": 97.04, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "for this 81st session of our assembly.", "start": 98.56, "duration": 9.68}, {"text": "Allow me to also", "start": 105.119, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "congratulate", "start": 108.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "his excellency Dr. Kalu Rahman on his", "start": 110.399, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "election as president of this session", "start": 114.399, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "and to wish him every success in his", "start": 117.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "noble mission.", "start": 121.759, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "I would", "start": 124.079, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "also like to pay a well-deserved tribute", "start": 126.399, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "to her excellency Miss Analena Berbok", "start": 130.319, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "for her work and her wisdom in guiding", "start": 133.52, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "the previous session.", "start": 137.84, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "I would also like", "start": 141.28, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "to pay tribute", "start": 144.64, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "to the leadership of his excellency", "start": 148.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Antonio Guterres,", "start": 152.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Secretary General of the United Nations,", "start": 154.4, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "and commend his commitment to peace and", "start": 157.28, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "development", "start": 161.68, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "at a time when the international order", "start": 164.56, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "is under severe strain", "start": 170.0, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "as he prepares to hand over the", "start": 173.84, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "leadership of our organization in an", "start": 177.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "international context marked by tension", "start": 180.4, "duration": 8.559}, {"text": "and uncertainty. I extend my best wishes", "start": 182.959, "duration": 9.721}, {"text": "to his successor.", "start": 188.959, "duration": 3.721}, {"text": "At a time", "start": 192.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "when uh", "start": 194.879, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "confidence in international institutions", "start": 197.12, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "is declining", "start": 200.08, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "and they're often perceived as favoring", "start": 204.0, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "power politics", "start": 206.879, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "over law. Our organization", "start": 208.879, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "must rise above partisan interests. God", "start": 213.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "willing.", "start": 217.519, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "The next leadership will embody unity", "start": 219.68, "duration": 9.52}, {"text": "and the renewal of a more credible", "start": 223.2, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "multilateralism and this will have the", "start": 229.2, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "full support of the Camaros.", "start": 231.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "He will be essential for that voice to", "start": 234.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "defend the aspirations of developing", "start": 237.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "countries, particularly small, island", "start": 239.28, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "and vulnerable states", "start": 243.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "and to foster collective responses to", "start": 246.4, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "the challenges we share.", "start": 250.72, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "For 81 years, this general assembly", "start": 253.439, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "has remained the central pillar of", "start": 258.959, "duration": 5.881}, {"text": "multilateralism.", "start": 261.84, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "And", "start": 267.12, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "now we're that we're meeting in New", "start": 269.12, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "York, humanity is at a crossroads.", "start": 270.96, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Despite our efforts,", "start": 276.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the sustainable development goals of the", "start": 279.04, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "2030 agenda remain unfortunately out of", "start": 282.88, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "reach. Growing inequalities,", "start": 287.04, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "the climate emergency, the fragility of", "start": 291.12, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "international peace,", "start": 294.56, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "all require renewed clarity and", "start": 297.52, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "determination on our part. Restoring", "start": 300.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "trust,", "start": 304.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "mutual respect, and equality before the", "start": 306.08, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "law", "start": 309.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "is our collective responsibility", "start": 312.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "during this 81st session.", "start": 315.28, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Mr. President, distinguished", "start": 318.24, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "participants, a year ago, we called in", "start": 321.12, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "this very hall for peace to be the", "start": 325.6, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "foundation of development and human", "start": 328.8, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "rights. 12 months later, we must", "start": 331.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "acknowledge", "start": 335.039, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "that the gap between our commitments and", "start": 336.56, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "reality remains evident.", "start": 339.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Everywhere around the world from the", "start": 342.639, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Middle East to this hael through the", "start": 344.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Great Lakes region in Eastern Europe and", "start": 347.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Latin America, civilian populations", "start": 350.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "continue to pay the high price of", "start": 353.199, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "conflict driven by interest that are", "start": 356.639, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "often hidden. The devastating war in the", "start": 360.479, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "Middle East, marked by massive civilian", "start": 364.16, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "losses and destruction of critical", "start": 367.12, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "infrastructure,", "start": 369.84, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "has spread to Syria and Lebanon as a", "start": 375.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "result", "start": 379.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "of Israeli military operations and has", "start": 381.28, "duration": 9.84}, {"text": "had major global economic consequences.", "start": 384.72, "duration": 10.88}, {"text": "In addition to its worldwide impact, the", "start": 391.12, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "conflict threatens", "start": 395.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the food and energy security of", "start": 398.319, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "vulnerable countries such as the Union", "start": 402.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "of the Camaros, which remain highly", "start": 404.319, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "dependent on imports and whose", "start": 407.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "population face declining purchasing", "start": 411.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "power and this demands", "start": 414.0, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "greater", "start": 417.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "international solidarity. ity given this", "start": 419.52, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "shared insecurity.", "start": 422.0, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "Mr. President, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 424.16, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "allowing the conflict in the Middle East", "start": 427.199, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "to continue directly weakens the United", "start": 429.36, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "Nations by calling into question its", "start": 433.36, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "ability to maintain world peace", "start": 437.52, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "and by undermining its credibility", "start": 442.24, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "amongst the peoples where we present.", "start": 445.599, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "The theme of this 81st session", "start": 449.919, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "acknowledges", "start": 452.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "that something is broken", "start": 454.8, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and that is why confidence must be", "start": 458.88, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "restored", "start": 462.0, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "through concrete actions that uphold the", "start": 465.759, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "rule of law and collective security. It", "start": 469.52, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "is time to move beyond power politics", "start": 473.28, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "and establish a new human ethic that", "start": 476.8, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "trans transcends divisions of race,", "start": 479.919, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "color, and belief", "start": 482.96, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "whilst safeguarding our shared", "start": 486.479, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "ecosystems.", "start": 489.199, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "Created in 1945", "start": 491.039, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "from the ruins of the Second World War,", "start": 493.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "our organization was founded to", "start": 496.8, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "guarantee peace, security,", "start": 499.919, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "and uh sovereign equality of states in", "start": 503.28, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "strict respect for international law.", "start": 507.199, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Without these principles, it would be", "start": 510.0, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "little more than an empty forum.", "start": 512.8, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Since our last meeting here in September", "start": 516.32, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "2025, the genocide in Palestine has", "start": 519.279, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "continued.", "start": 523.039, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "Hundreds of thousands of Palestinian", "start": 524.64, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "civilians, women, children, and elderly", "start": 526.88, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "have lost their lives and entire", "start": 531.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "populations", "start": 535.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "stand on the brink of extermination.", "start": 537.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "The international community will regain", "start": 540.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "its credibility first by taking urgent", "start": 542.88, "duration": 9.36}, {"text": "action to silence the guns to protect", "start": 546.8, "duration": 8.719}, {"text": "civilian lives", "start": 552.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "whether Israeli, Palestinian, Lebanese", "start": 555.519, "duration": 6.121}, {"text": "or Syrian", "start": 558.32, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "and ultimately implementing United", "start": 562.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Nations resolutions including the", "start": 565.44, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "two-state solution.", "start": 567.839, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "with Israel and Palestine coexisting", "start": 569.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "peacefully.", "start": 572.72, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "This is a prerequisite", "start": 575.04, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "for", "start": 579.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "addressing climate change,", "start": 581.279, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "the risks of artificial intelligence and", "start": 585.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "the um imperative of sustainable", "start": 588.399, "duration": 5.481}, {"text": "development.", "start": 590.88, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We will make the right to development a", "start": 594.08, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "pillar of multilateralism by", "start": 597.839, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "facilitating access to sustainable", "start": 599.92, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "funding and reducing inequalities", "start": 602.64, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "globally.", "start": 604.88, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, please allow me to", "start": 606.56, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "quote the great African writer Chinoa", "start": 608.64, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "who said the following. When we gather", "start": 612.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "in the village under the moonlight, it's", "start": 615.04, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "not because of the moon. Each person can", "start": 618.72, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "see the moon in his own backyard. We", "start": 621.92, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "gather because it is good to do so. Let", "start": 625.2, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "us continue in a spirit of teamwork and", "start": 628.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "draw strength from solidarity. If we", "start": 631.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "smile together, it is not because we", "start": 634.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "have no problems but because we are", "start": 637.6, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "stronger than our problems.", "start": 640.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 644.399, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "for half a century,", "start": 647.2, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "the Camorian state, still striving for", "start": 649.519, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "full sovereignty within its", "start": 654.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "internationally recognized borders,", "start": 656.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "remains", "start": 659.92, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "under what it considers an illegal", "start": 661.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "French occupation. Despite the many", "start": 664.56, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "relevant resolutions of this assembly,", "start": 666.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "the Camorian side has always favored a", "start": 669.519, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "peaceful settlement of this dispute and", "start": 672.72, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "has always believed that dialogue is the", "start": 675.76, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "only alternative.", "start": 680.079, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "And we have engaged in such a dialogue", "start": 682.959, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "with France for two decades in an effort", "start": 685.44, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "to reach a peaceful solution of this", "start": 689.44, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "dispute once described by former French", "start": 693.6, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "president Fran as unpleasant and we", "start": 696.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "regret that this dialogue has not", "start": 699.839, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "succeeded. On the contrary, France's", "start": 701.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "unilateral actions particularly in", "start": 704.64, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Africa run counter to our expectations.", "start": 707.2, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "We deeply regret attempts by", "start": 711.44, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "some neighboring brotherly and friendly", "start": 716.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "countries which have long defended the", "start": 718.959, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "sovereignty and territorial integrity of", "start": 721.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the Camaros to establish relations with", "start": 724.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "what we regard as an occupied part of", "start": 727.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "our territory. We appeal to the", "start": 730.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "solidarity that African countries have", "start": 732.959, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "always demonstrated", "start": 736.399, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "in defending sovereignty and in", "start": 738.639, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "particular the territorial integrity of", "start": 741.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "the Camaros.", "start": 744.48, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "We strongly condemn initiatives of", "start": 747.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "cooperation", "start": 750.56, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "with the local authorities of Mayot as", "start": 752.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "well as a recent statement by the French", "start": 755.279, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "prime minister linking development", "start": 758.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "assistance to the pursuit of migrants", "start": 760.639, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "under general assembly resolution 3385", "start": 763.68, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "of 12th November 1975", "start": 768.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and 314", "start": 772.0, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "of the 21st November 1976", "start": 773.92, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "and", "start": 778.32, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Security Council resolution 376.", "start": 781.68, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Camorans are at home in Mayot.", "start": 785.44, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "For the Camorian nation, sovereignty", "start": 789.04, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "of the entire archipelago is not for", "start": 792.959, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "sale.", "start": 796.24, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "We therefore urge the French authorities", "start": 798.32, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "to rethink their political narrative to", "start": 804.639, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "reconsider recently announced measures", "start": 808.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "and pro", "start": 810.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "productive cooperation and mutually", "start": 813.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "beneficial partnership for both France", "start": 815.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "and the Camaros.", "start": 818.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "It is an imperative to build a", "start": 820.72, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "harmonious future.", "start": 824.079, "duration": 3.801}, {"text": "and to overcome the traditional ways of", "start": 829.2, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "thinking and doing things. Mr.", "start": 832.8, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "President, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 835.279, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "development remains at the heart of our", "start": 836.639, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "national ambition. Since 2019, the", "start": 838.959, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "Kamaros has implemented the emerging", "start": 842.0, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "Camaro's plan, a road map designed to", "start": 844.88, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "modernize infrastructure,", "start": 849.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "stimulate the private sector, and", "start": 853.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "provide decent jobs for our youth.", "start": 855.36, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "With financing needs of 5.2 billion over", "start": 858.72, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "10 years, the plan is the driving force", "start": 863.04, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "of our transformation.", "start": 866.56, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "We have seen tangible progress. The", "start": 869.92, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "economic growth, for example, which went", "start": 873.04, "duration": 9.52}, {"text": "from 1.9 in 2019 to 3.8 in 2025. Yet,", "start": 876.24, "duration": 9.039}, {"text": "there's still a long road ahead of us.", "start": 882.56, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "We need to mobilize greater levels of", "start": 885.279, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "both domestic and external funding so as", "start": 888.24, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "to attain our goals.", "start": 891.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Now given this scarcity and rising cost", "start": 894.48, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "of financial resources", "start": 896.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "particularly because of the access", "start": 900.32, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "criteria for concessional financing and", "start": 902.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "they often of they often fail to reflect", "start": 905.04, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "reality for", "start": 907.839, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "a small island state such as ours income", "start": 911.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "indicators alone do not capture our", "start": 914.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "multi-dimensional vulnerability and that", "start": 917.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "is why we in the Camaro's call for a", "start": 919.839, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "profound reform. reform of the", "start": 923.44, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "international financial architecture.", "start": 924.639, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Such reform is essential to guarantee", "start": 926.959, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "our right to development and to ensure", "start": 929.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "that multilateral banks finally take", "start": 932.24, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "account of our vulnerabilities", "start": 936.24, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "in their allocation policies.", "start": 939.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "encouraged by positive macroeconomic", "start": 942.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "results and our determination to reach", "start": 945.68, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "higher middle income status.", "start": 949.36, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "We are now entering a decisive phase for", "start": 952.88, "duration": 8.879}, {"text": "the period 2027 to 2030.", "start": 957.44, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "We will", "start": 961.759, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "accelerate implementation of the", "start": 964.399, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "emerging Camaro's plan", "start": 966.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "and we invite our bilateral and", "start": 969.759, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "multilateral partners as well as the", "start": 972.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "private sector to join us in", "start": 975.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "transforming this ambition into a", "start": 977.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "lasting reality for the Camorian people.", "start": 980.079, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 982.88, "duration": 3.319}, {"text": "I would like to also express my deep", "start": 986.959, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "gratitude for the inscription during the", "start": 989.44, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "most recent session of the World", "start": 992.079, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Heritage Committee in Busousan of six", "start": 993.759, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "medas of the historic Camoran Sultanates", "start": 996.639, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "on UNESCO's World Heritage list. This", "start": 999.92, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "historic recognition is the fruit of 20", "start": 1002.959, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "years of work and it honors our nation.", "start": 1006.24, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "I would like to express our gratitude to", "start": 1009.199, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "all of the partners who helped us", "start": 1012.48, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "technically and financially and", "start": 1015.04, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "ultimately made this possible.", "start": 1017.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Furthermore,", "start": 1021.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "our country in one year's time, the", "start": 1023.68, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "Union of the Kamuros will host for the", "start": 1026.16, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "first time in its history the Indian", "start": 1028.319, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Ocean Islands Games. This major youth", "start": 1030.4, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "sporting event promotes", "start": 1033.28, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "cohesion and personal development in a", "start": 1037.039, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "world", "start": 1039.839, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "far too often marked by division and", "start": 1043.679, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "rejection of diversity.", "start": 1047.199, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "And here I would like to on behalf of", "start": 1052.32, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "the Camorian people, I would like to", "start": 1055.28, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "thank all of the countries and partners", "start": 1057.28, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "whose support has helped make this", "start": 1059.679, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "national", "start": 1064.64, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "and regional undertaking possible.", "start": 1066.32, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "We", "start": 1070.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "intend to make this event a resounding", "start": 1071.84, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "success.", "start": 1077.2, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Mr. President, in conclusion, I call for", "start": 1079.36, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "ambitious action to restore confidence", "start": 1083.039, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "amongst our nations and do it through", "start": 1086.88, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "fairness, justice, and solidarity. Let", "start": 1090.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "us transform the United Nations, our", "start": 1094.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "common home, into", "start": 1097.12, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "a more credible organization and a", "start": 1100.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "source of hope for the future.", "start": 1103.52, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "It is only then that we will truly", "start": 1106.32, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "empower ourselves to act in all humanity", "start": 1109.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "for humanity and all of its differences", "start": 1112.64, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "and diversity. I thank you.", "start": 1115.28, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": ">> On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1121.679, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "thank the president of the union of the", "start": 1123.44, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "kamoros.", "start": 1125.28, "duration": 3.0}]